  id: side.lastline.ploplings
  title: Ploplings at the West Gate
  category: 2
  description: Torvald wants the Ploplings in the field west of Lastline thinned
    out.
  givenAutomatically: 0
  offeredBy: torvald
  offerText: 'Ploplings again. They come bouncing through the west gate every morning
    and nobody does a thing about it.


    Go out to the field west of town and
    put down ten of them. Come back and tell me, and I''ll make it worth your while.'
  reward:
    gold: 300
    experience: 25
    items:
    - itemId: item.minor-healing-potion
      count: 5
